{"4261430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "迷渡桥", "steam_appid": 4261430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《迷渡桥》是一款古风探案游戏，你是涉及谋逆罪的江家后人，意外卷入一起离奇凶杀案，被凶手活埋棺材内，在弥留之际踏上迷渡桥，七日内找出家族灭门真相。通过检验尸体、勘察现场和出示证物，推理出事件真相，探寻这场人心与权谋的惊天迷局！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/cb8bc73fe0e9392852ea04dcf194c530.poster.avif?t=1783490080\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/cb8bc73fe0e9392852ea04dcf194c530.webm?t=1783490080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/cb8bc73fe0e9392852ea04dcf194c530.mp4?t=1783490080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/bae4e5b26ed1a7ab0b36094f145db76a.avif?t=1783490080\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在追查灭门真相过程中，你卷入一桩又一桩离奇命案中，你将通过检验尸体，找出致命伤和凶器，探寻作案动机。勘察现场，抽丝剥茧搜集证物，推演案件过程。出示证物，指认凶手，破解事件真相！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/d2af3c13ee9e2b933c1ba9a7b4a4e460.poster.avif?t=1783490080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/d2af3c13ee9e2b933c1ba9a7b4a4e460.webm?t=1783490080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/d2af3c13ee9e2b933c1ba9a7b4a4e460.mp4?t=1783490080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/33ad201598bd1a97d94fa1d2554d38b8.avif?t=1783490080\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >表面毫无关联的一桩桩案件当中，涉及的人物关系却是复杂交错，最终指向那波谲云诡的朝堂和权力争斗。而你，需要推理复杂的线索和人物关系，拨开迷雾，找到灭门惨案的最终真相！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/6b1b82760e7457f8910a19424e56bda2.poster.avif?t=1783490080\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/6b1b82760e7457f8910a19424e56bda2.webm?t=1783490080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/6b1b82760e7457f8910a19424e56bda2.mp4?t=1783490080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/0be1c8226dcfb2dfd905ef73aae8f075.avif?t=1783490080\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >案件中出现的人物有人人唾弃的罪臣之后、身份低微的鬼市商人、万民景仰的四方城圣女等，看似没有交集的人物关系中有隐藏在暗处的连接。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/856149824d5355b0f7ac2ba233c18c25.poster.avif?t=1783490080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/856149824d5355b0f7ac2ba233c18c25.webm?t=1783490080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/856149824d5355b0f7ac2ba233c18c25.mp4?t=1783490080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/a06b2e1add8f5aa7ab9a2f3f3290a070.avif?t=1783490080\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/a61cb9d052ba0b600b3b736d7807e41e.avif?t=1783490080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras_big/a61cb9d052ba0b600b3b736d7807e41e.avif?t=1783490080 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宁不移，云启皇陵，守冰的凌人。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >江烟落处空，不移归魂梦。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/24d9e9534214e87ef4202bb48538e75a.avif?t=1783490080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras_big/24d9e9534214e87ef4202bb48538e75a.avif?t=1783490080 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玉沐风，被贬的寻玉使</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玉魄沐恩深，风刃斩前尘。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/1566cdbde428eacd7bb12ff981c17058.avif?t=1783490080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras_big/1566cdbde428eacd7bb12ff981c17058.avif?t=1783490080 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >洛应然，京城洛家的三公子</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >尚贤贵公子，尚同洛应然。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/48b05cf32682cc78f783be163aceb6c8.avif?t=1783490080\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras_big/48b05cf32682cc78f783be163aceb6c8.avif?t=1783490080 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >止鳞，生前为探尉将军</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >止命长生密，鳞甲化羽翼</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《迷渡桥》是一款古风探案游戏，你是涉及谋逆罪的江家后人，意外卷入一起离奇凶杀案，被凶手活埋棺材内，在弥留之际踏上迷渡桥，七日内找出家族灭门真相。通过检验尸体、勘察现场和出示证物，推理出事件真相，探寻这场人心与权谋的惊天迷局！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/cb8bc73fe0e9392852ea04dcf194c530.poster.avif?t=1783490080\" width=1170 height=682 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/cb8bc73fe0e9392852ea04dcf194c530.webm?t=1783490080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/cb8bc73fe0e9392852ea04dcf194c530.mp4?t=1783490080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/bae4e5b26ed1a7ab0b36094f145db76a.avif?t=1783490080\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >在追查灭门真相过程中，你卷入一桩又一桩离奇命案中，你将通过检验尸体，找出致命伤和凶器，探寻作案动机。勘察现场，抽丝剥茧搜集证物，推演案件过程。出示证物，指认凶手，破解事件真相！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/d2af3c13ee9e2b933c1ba9a7b4a4e460.poster.avif?t=1783490080\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/d2af3c13ee9e2b933c1ba9a7b4a4e460.webm?t=1783490080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4261430/extras/d2af3c13ee9e2b933c1ba9a7b4a4e460.m